  questId: c3_billing
  questName: The Month's Bills
  primaryRiasec: C
  questionCode: C3
  objectiveText: Get every customer's bill right before it goes out.
  questDescription: The store's accounts are due. The billing list has printed a
    stack of statements, but some of the amounts don't match what the ledger says.
  questHints:
  - Check the amounts against the ledger before anything goes out.
  - Or sort them by customer - half of these are in the wrong pile.
  nextQuestId: 
  lockType: 0
  requiredSkillTag: 
  isExposureEligible: 0
